# Fixed schema ids for es-liquidity-engine-service (the ES MBO liquidity engine; NEW, dev only). Contracts options-edge-contracts 0.70.0 to 0.73.0 (schemas-registry/esmbo):
# ids 3502, 3503, 3504, 3505 and 3506, version 1, namespace com.optionsedge.contracts.esmbo, subject = the record full name (RecordNameStrategy), compatibility FULL. One record TYPE per topic:
# es.mbo.level-flow 3502, es.mbo.liquidity-events 3503, es.mbo.health 3504, es.mbo.snapshot 3505, es.mbo.level-flow-final 3506. Id 3501 of the design (the closure record) is free: closures are a later pull request. The service writes with
